window.products.push({"id":866026,"name":"Oyydecor 100ft Garden Hose, Expandable Water Hose with 3/4\" Solid Brass Fittings, Flexible Lightweight Water Hose Extra Strength Fabric - Flexible Exp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818FeK1oL+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NEED ENOUGH WATER PRESSURE】 - After being checked by our professional quality department, garden hoses must wait while in use and more than 5kg of water must flow into the garden water pipe so that the water pressure continues to increase until the length of the water pipe continues to expand, and then the sprinkler can released for use. Do not open the sprinkler head beforehand while draining water, otherwise the water pipe will not reach the original length. 【WEAR-RESISTANT AND HIGHLY FLEXIBLE】 -Flexible water hose covered with strong, abrasion-resistant polyester fabric, which can effectively protect the high-pressure triple-hard-wearing layers of latex hose-pipe. Kink-free use and easy handling make watering your garden much easier. The expandable garden hose is compact when not in use. After switching off the water, the hose empties and shrinks back to almost its original size. 【SUPER EASY TO USE AND STORAGE】 - Using and storing is a breeze thanks to the incredibly expanding design. Comes with a free storage bag - an easy way to save storage space. When not in use, simply drain the water from the hose, place it in the bag and store it out of the sun. 【MULTIFUNCTION NOZZLE】 - The ergonomic hand is non-slip and comfortable with a comfortable grip. Rotating bezel to choose from 9 types of spray: Flat, Shower, Cone, Fog, Full, Medium, Jet, Angle and Soaker. Different settings to suit your taste, various possible uses. 【LIGHTWEIGHT AND PRACTICAL】 - The flexible hose really expands from 10 to 30 meters and is also so light that even a child can water the garden with it, and makes the garden hose an irreplaceable gardening aid, also ideal for washing cars and cleaning windows and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818FeK1oL+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oyydecor","source_asin":"B08NC4MT5D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NC4MT5D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NC4MT5D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
