window.products.push({"id":866048,"name":"Matfer 215000 Mandoline Vegetable Slicer, With Pusher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":236.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w1w3MVyeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description THE MATFER Stainless Steel MANDOLINE has been designed to be easy to use: It has one handle to hold in position during the chef's work, a smooth inclined plane, a perfect adjustment of the blades by milled nuts (6) and one adjustable foot. With the concept of the blade holders delivered with the Matfer Mandoline, you easily switch from 10 to 60 blades (4) (including 38 combination) in a few seconds and revert to the embossed or plain central blades (2) in a simple operation. After a long period of usage, you can sharpen the knives and correct the play of the blades for more precise cuts. Is easy to clean: No more screws and nooks anywhere to catch food. Each part is smooth and quick to dismantle. THE MATFER Stainless Steel MANDOLINE pusher does not limit the size of your vegetables and avoids waste by creating fewer vegetable heels. Comes with combinations of 30, 20, 10 (including 38 or 60) blades, carver and waffle. Mandoline includes pusher. Amazon.com Long favored by professional chefs, the traditional mandoline is still the best tool for creating precise, uniform slices of fruits or vegetables. Ideal for waffle cuts and julienne, it can produce attractive pommes Anna or paper-thin slices of cuke in record time. This French-made stainless steel mandoline is designed to make the slicing process both easier and safer, with a smooth inclined plane for a work surface, an adjustable folding foot, and a single handle to hold the device securely in place. Eminently adaptable for every cutting task in your kitchen, the Matfer features a slanted blade and plate that adjusts slicing width from 1-/4-inch thick to microscopically thin. A unique blade holder design permits users to julienne strips in 1/8, 3/16, and 3/8-inch sizes, then revert almost instantly to the reversible straight/serrated central blade for waffle cuts or straight slices. Unlike other mandolines, the Matfer's free-floating pusher assembly lets you slice any size vegetable and limits the waste that often occurs at the end of a piece of food. (For safety's sake, always use the pusher, which protects hands from extraordinarily sharp blades.) Also unlike other mandolines, the blades can be sharpened and adjusted, which, however should not be necessary for some time. Because there are no hidden screws and nooks, this unit is also remarkably easy to clean and take apart. It's safe to use in the dishwasher, although extreme caution should be used when handling the blades. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w1w3MVyeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Matfer","source_asin":"B0006ABV5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006ABV5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006ABV5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
