window.products.push({"id":866088,"name":"AILEEKISS Computer Desk with 5 Drawers Home Office Writing Desk for Bedroom Student Study Laptop Workstation Modern Simple Makeup Vanity Table for Sma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ZqWEsDLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you want a multi-function writing desk that can write, learn, make up, and work? Just buy this.Detachable hutch(which is made of two small drawers ,two storage case and shelf), provide you a great convience,it is very suit saving for makeup or some small things.So, you can use this writing desk to make up. In addition, the table has three large drawers, which can store some books, documents and other office supplies.If you need more office space, you can unload this hutch. Also, the table is made of natural wood, environmentally friendly and odor-free, wood frame + solid wood legs to ensure the desk is stable and durable. When you receive the goods, you will find it easy to assemble according to the instructions, no need to worry about assembly problems. If you are fond of it, just buy it ,we believe it is worth your favorite! Features: 1. Detachable hutch 2. Ample storage space and a large desktop 3. Wood frame + solid wood legs 4. Beautiful and practical design 5. Easy to assemble Specification： Color:White+Black Material:Solid wood&MDF board Overall dimension:（39.4’’L*17.7’’W*29.1’’H） Middle drawer measuring:(11.8’’L*11.1’’W*4.3’’H) Side drawer measuring:(11.6L*11.1W*4.3H) Two small drawers measuring:(8.6’’L*3.9’’W*2.3’’H) Note: 1. All dimensions are measured manually, there may be 1-2 inch error. 2. Please confirm the address before ordered. 3. If the goods are damaged during transportation or if there are any problems during use, please contact us in time. Due to the time difference between China and the United States, we will reply you after saw your message.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ZqWEsDLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AILEEKISS","source_asin":"B07ZZ5SS9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZZ5SS9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZZ5SS9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":866089,"name":"Bruntmor JONAX 34 Oz French Press Double Filter Screens, Borosilicate Heat Resistant Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ppx+augtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making coffee via French Press is more of an art than science. There are a few fundamentals to follow, but beyond that, everyone's got their own recipe. A uniquely designed and crafted French Press with fine construction makes a wonderful coffee and tea making experience. Commonly known as a French Press coffee maker, this style of manual coffee making has been long accepted as perhaps the best way to make full flavored coffee. By allowing the coarse ground coffee to infuser completely over a few minutes, the flavors and oils extracted in this process are unmatched.   With 3 bonus screens you'll never need to spend more money on extra filters like you would for other coffee makers. Now you can make thousands of cups of coffee without needing any more supplies than your water and ground coffee beans. French Press Tips For best taste, freshly ground coffee is more important than having perfectly sized grounds. So if the cost of a burr grinder is prohibitive, choose to buy whole beans and grind at home with a cheap blade grinder versus buying pre-ground coffee.    Pour out the brewed coffee into a carafe if you're not going to drink it right away. Don't leave it in the French Press or else it will get really strong and bitter.   Add a dash of cinnamon or nutmeg to the coffee grounds to spice things up.  The French Press is great for its portability! Perfect for camping because you only have one item (the press pot) and no need for electricity.  A chopstick is great for stirring. Try to avoid using a metal spoon as it causes micro cracks in the glass of the French Press and increases the chance it will shatter.  Clean the press pot well. It makes a difference in taste because droplets of oil from the coffee can go rancid and ruin your next cup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ppx+augtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bruntmor","source_asin":"B01FXZRHIY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FXZRHIY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FXZRHIY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
