window.products.push({"id":866174,"name":"DOMICARE 30oz Tumbler with Lid, Stainless Steel Insulated Travel Mug, Double Wall Coffee Cup, Durable Powder Coated Insulated Tumbler Cup for Ice and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7195YAJiHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL TUMBLER : Tumbler is made from high quality 304 18/8 food grade stainless steel, which allows the cup to withstand bigger impact. 100% Safe and BPA FREE. strong and durable, makes the tumbler is unbreakable for long time use. It also rust resistant and easy-reach to clean by hand. Replace your plastic cup and mug with Our tumbler. Straw hole on the top for easy sipping. VACUUM INSULATED COFFEE CUP: 30oz Insulated tumbler has vacuum double wall design which ensures a good insulation.Under normal temperature, the insulated tumbler was tested to guarantee its high vacuum degree to keep your drinks hot for up3 hours and cold for up 9 hours. So you can enjoy your favorite beverage at the perfect temperature anytime, anywhere. PORTABLE SUPER-CAPACITY TRAVEL MUG：Due to its vacuum insulated design, no matter how cold or hot inside, the exterior is SWEAT FREE and pleasant to hold. Colored powder coating gives the container a textured and vibrant finish.In dimension, the lid diameter is 3.4\", the body height is 7.9\" while the bottom width is 2.8\". Curved body for easy holding and fits in most vehicle cup holders. A WONDERFUL GIFT 0F 30 OZ TUMBLER SET: 30oz tumbler modern design and new waist shape stand out .A Great gift option for yourself, friends and family. Buy with confident for something that you and everyone will like. We offer more than 10 colors that will surely fit every personality and suitable for various places, such like sports, traveling, camping and driving ,BBQ experts, party favors ect. 100% GUARANTEE: Domicare is determined to provide the best tumbler and high quality service.We are so confident in the quality of our product. Money back guarantee if you are not 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7195YAJiHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOMICARE","source_asin":"B08LMLYXKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LMLYXKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LMLYXKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":866175,"name":"Silicone Chocolate Candy Molds [Star, 15 Cup] - Non Stick, BPA Free, Reusable 100% Silicon & Dishwasher Safe Silicon - Kitchen Rubber Tray For Ice, Cr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717NznXFBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create your own special holiday-shaped sweets or homemade soaps with the fresh ware cb-613br 15-cavity silicone super star chocolate, candy and gummy mold. This mold is constructed with 100-percent pure, professional quality food-grade silicone (BPA, PVC and phthalate free). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the mold, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone mold offers a non-stick surface that allows the sweets to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone mold on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. mold Size: 9 x 4.1 X 0.7 Inch. Cavity size: 1 x 1 x 0.7 Inch. Volume: 15 x 0.3 Oz., Total 4.5 Oz. Many Customers have found creative ways to use fresh ware silicone molds (depending upon the shape) to create delicious chocolates, candies, gummies, butters, caramels, ice cubes, frozen baby foods, gelatin, ice creams etc. Other customers use the molds in unique ways to create clays, resin casting, candles, soaps and more. All fresh ware silicone products do not have chemical coatings and are pinch test passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the oven, refrigerator, freezer, microwave, steamer and dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What is a pinch test? cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it's got fillers as 100-percent pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717NznXFBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B08946YTC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08946YTC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08946YTC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
