window.products.push({"id":866260,"name":"Empire Art Direct Tropical Parrot Dimensional Collage Handmade by Alex Zeng Framed Graphic Wall Art Ready to Hang, 33\" x 17\" x 1.4\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mNHV4almL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"About EADEmpire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948.At EAD , we are proud to be creating the best decorative products on the market.Our decoratives are over 1,000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorative for all moments in your life.Features• Item Name: Empire Art Direct Tropical Parrot Dimensional Collage Handmade by Alex Zeng Framed Graphic Wall Art, 33\" x 17\" x 1.4\", Ready to Hang• Model Name: Tropical Parrot• Color: Yellow, Blue, Red• Style: Contemporary, Vintage• Meterial: Paper, Wood Frame, Tempered Glass Lens• Technics: Hand-cut paper art collage under tempered glass in black wood frame• Packing: Packing with Styrofoam in every side and protective corners in carton• Product Size & Weight: 17\"L x 33\"W x 1.4\"D & 10 lbs• Package Size & Weight: 35.2\"L x 20.9\"W x 3.3\"D & 11.9 lbsDecorationAnyone who has traveled the rain forests of South America has probably Heard the Screech of a tropical Parrot. These birds have been popular companions throughout history because they are intelligent, charismatic, colorful, and musical. Some Parrots can imitate many non-avian sounds, including human Speech. Alex zeng’s multi-colored tropical Parrot piece seems to call out to you with every intricate detail, becoming more apparent the longer you look. Bird and nature lovers will adore this piece as it has its place in any tropical themed collection.About returns policy and our servicesIf you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services.Check out Empire Art Direct for more choices!ORDER NOW!DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mNHV4almL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B072F9H5LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072F9H5LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072F9H5LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":866261,"name":"Raymond Waites Padded Clothes Hangers (Set of 8) NLM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Xg5vf8K9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Gently padded and covered in soft cotton fabric, this set of 8 padded hangers is perfect for use in any closet. Whether you’re a perfectionist at organization and need all of your closet accessories to coordinate, or you just want to hang a few special garments on protective hangers, this vintage inspired set lends style and added function to your closet design. With polyester padding for soft support and a gently rounded design that helps garments to maintain their shape, this set of hangers makes it easy to spot your favorite garments in the closet or keep delicate fabrics from getting crushed against one another. Available in a range of solid colors and stylish prints, these hangers are accented with small details that give them a vintage inspired look. The solid color combinations are accented with tiny metal button details while the printed hangers are embellished with little cotton ties that wrap around the center and knot into a bow at the base of the hook. The casual and charming look makes these hangers the perfect addition to any closet, whether you’re hanging evening dresses and tailored suits or breezy cotton summer dresses and beach caftans. Redesign your closet by buying multiple sets of matching hangers for a consistent, organized look or mixing and matching different packs of the solid colors and soft cotton prints to create a unique look or to separate his and hers items in a shared closet. Whether you’re hanging delicate women’s blouses or crisp men’s work shirts, the cushioned padding keeps the shoulders of your garments where they need to be and won’t leave residual marks the way that traditional plastic hangers often do.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Xg5vf8K9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raymond Waites","source_asin":"B00M0XZM76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M0XZM76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M0XZM76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
