window.products.push({"id":866307,"name":"Ritual aromatic red altar candle\"Hecate.\" It is used both for love magic and for dedication in the tradition of the Dark Mother!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpiu7ziDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Candle \"Hecate\" Created from natural wax and paraffin with natural red dye, with the addition of silver dust, which makes it more fascinating when burning is used in ritual, magical practices (witchcraft). Turning to Hecate , lighting a candle, you can ask for help in solving many issues. The candle can be used as an altar in the form of gratitude to the Dark Goddess! Made in the shape of a pyramid, because Hecate is the tripartite patron of witchcraft Burning time about 5-6 hour. Height - 5.11 inches (13 cm) Weight - 3.17 oz (90g) CANDLE CARE INSTRUCTIONS Always burn the candle on a stable, heat-resistant surface. Keep away from drafts and flammable materials. Do not move the candle while burning. Never place candles directly on furniture. NEVER leave a burning candle unattended. Keep out of reach of children and pets Candles are packed in environmentally friendly shavings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpiu7ziDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07YJZTSBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YJZTSBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YJZTSBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
