window.products.push({"id":866334,"name":"Luxspire Bathroom Accessories Set, 4 Pcs Glass Bathroom Organizer Countertop Set, Bathroom Vanity Tray, Lotion Soap Dispenser, Tumbler Cup, Soap Dish ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I14dx8inL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Complete Bathroom Accessories Decorative Set】: This 4 pcs bathroom accessory set includes: 1 x dispenser pump, 1 x toothbrush cup, 1 x soap dish, 1 x swab box, a complete bathroom accessory kit equipping everything you need to store your toiletries and keep your countertop neat and tidy. A unified style of gradient blue hammer eye pattern glass, adds elegance and charm to any room modern or rustic. An ideal organized combination of fashion and convenience. 【Premium Sturdy Bathroom Set】: Made of high quality glass material, they are all built to be sturdy, leak proof, durable and safe for dishwasher. Hammer eye pattern glass provides a textured touch to be slip-resistant and safe. Wear-resisting, no need to worry about the texture wearing off over time and will always look new and charming. Note: Wipe clean with a damp cloth, or put them in the dishwasher. 【Rustproof & Leakage-free Pump】: Premium Rustproof ABS sturdy pump ensures the soap dispenser bottle in this set no clogging, and brings you smooth squeezing experience. The stick-out spout ensures liquid won't drip on the bottle to keep your countertop in the bathroom & kitchen clean and neat. Wide opening easy to refill liquid hand dispenser bottle. Semi-clear bottle body always makes it easy to see the consumption and remind you to replenish. 【Functional & Elegant Bath Ensemble】: Lotion dispenser pump to fill with dish soap, body cleanser, lotion, body wash, perfume, shampoos; Tumbler for your toothbrush, toothpaste, glasses; Soap Dish to hold soaps, sponges, jewelry; Qtip holder for Cotton Ball,Cotton Swab,Q-tips,Rounds,bath salts, small items. You are free to put this glass set in the bathroom vanity countertop, kitchen sink, ect. To keep your daily necessities in one place and create a stunning look for your room. 【An Ideal Gift】: Exquisite, graceful and functional, Luxspire bathroom accessory set is sure to be a good household helper and sleek decoration, thus a nice gift package for housewarming, weddings, birthdays, Valentine's, Thanksgiving, Christmas, anniversary. A special and useful gift for your lover, families, friends that appreciate exclusive-looking home decor items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I14dx8inL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxspire","source_asin":"B09DGD8Q6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DGD8Q6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DGD8Q6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
