window.products.push({"id":866404,"name":"New Metro Design 6L-MR Beater Blade METAL, works w/most KitchenAid 6, 7 and 8 Quart Bowl-Lift Stand Mixers, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFCkmvWBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is the 6L-MR Metal Beater Blade for KitchenAid 6, 7 & 8 Quart Bowl-Lift mixers. It is NOT for the Professional 5-Plus mixer, 5-Quart Bowl-Lift mixer, Tilt Hear Mixer or any other manufacturer’s brand of mixers or other KitchenAid mixer sizes. It is designed for the 6, 7 & 8 Quart Bowl-Lift mixers only—but how to know if this will work on YOUR bowl, you ask? Simply measure the diameter of your stand mixer bowl---if it measures 9.5-inches across, then the 6L-MR is the correct size BeaterBlade for your mixer! This 6L-MR BeaterBlade WILL NOT work on Professional 5-Plus mixers, Professional 6000 Series mixers with narrow flared/tulip bowls or 6500 “F” series 6-Quart mixers or their Glass mixing bowls. It Will NOT work with ANY glass bowls. If your Flat Beater has an “F” stamped on it, BeaterBlade will not work on your machine. The BeaterBlade is awesome, it can just be a bit tricky trying to order the correct size blade! Also….getting your BeaterBlade on the shaft the first time can be fiddly business. If you have ANY challenges, please call the fine folks at New Metro Design and they can help guide you through the process. BeaterBlade METAL, the latest introduction from the inventor of the Original BeaterBlade! This metal BeaterBlade replaces the flat beater that comes with most stand mixers, it will elevate your mixing experience…it is the ultimate continuous bowl scraper for bowl lift stand mixers. PLEASE BE CAREFUL TO ORDER THE CORRECT SIZE BLADE! Delivering confidence and unmatched performance in beating, scraping and folding ingredients for perfect batters or the thickest dough. From its commercial grade construction to its strong aluminum frame – comparatively speaking, it’s unbeatable. The BeaterBlade patented Wing-Blade technology pushes ingredients down to the dimple, in the bottom of the bowl, thoroughly combining all ingredients, 50% faster. To achieve a fluffy, aerated mixture (think creamed butter and sugar), beat at a higher speed. To achieve a smooth, thick mixture (think cheese cake), beat at lower speed. Either way, you can use the BeaterBlade as a hand-held spatula to scrape every bit of batter into the pan. The powder coated aluminum frame brings the ultimate in durability. The flexible plastic blade is free of rubber, silicone and Teflon. Double-overmold construction bonds the plastic blade to the metal frame with no cracks or crevices for food to get stuck in, meeting commercial grade food sanitation standards. For the best success only operate the BeaterBlade with ingredients in the bowl. In order to maintain the beauty and high shine finish, hand washing is strongly suggested.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cFCkmvWBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Metro Design","source_asin":"B0BKHCVVV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKHCVVV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKHCVVV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
