window.products.push({"id":866418,"name":"Luxe Home Spiced Sugar Plum Reed Diffuser Refill Oil with Sticks | Ripe Plums, Honey, Cinnamon & Allspice | Liquid Air Freshener | Includes Replacemen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gRHI2SoHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ripe plums, Honey & Allspice. Sugary plums simmered in brandy with shavings of nutmeg, ginger, allspice and cinnamon leaf spooned over creamy tapioca and drizzled with a honeyed vanilla glaze. Available exclusively on Amazon! LUXE HOME™ Essential Oil Reed Diffuser Oil Refills are modern room fresheners made with an artisanal blend of fine essential oils which will scent a large room for up to 4 months. • Made here in the USA! • Alcohol-Free. Paraben-Free. Phthalate-Free. 100% Vegan. • Designed to be used in any room of your home all-day, everyday. • Specially formulated to subtly scent your home with the fragrances you love. To use: Unscrew cap. Pour oil into the glass vessel of your choice. Insert the included bamboo reed sticks. Place near a door, window or a high traffic area for best result. To refresh the fragrance, simply turn reeds upside down periodically. Our reeds are designed to gently release the fragrance slowly and evenly into the air for approximately 4 months. Tip #1: Place in the right spot.Air movement from outside or the motion of your household helps circulate the scent, creating the ideal “throw” of fragrance. Tip #2: Flip your reeds. Rattan reeds work to wick the scented oils from the container to the air, producing the fragrant impact you desire. By flipping them regularly, you’ll keep the scent at its freshest and most fragrant. Tip #3: Adjust scent to the desired intensity. To either heighten or lessen the fragrance level, simply increase or decrease the number of reeds placed in your vessel. Tip #4: Replace Reeds after 90 days. Once the reeds become saturated, their cells get clogged, reducing their ability to wick and throw fragrance. Your Satisfaction is Our Top Priority! If for any reason you are not happy with our scents, please contact us for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gRHI2SoHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXEHOME","source_asin":"B07RNL6PFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RNL6PFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RNL6PFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
