window.products.push({"id":866605,"name":"Ucalafee Milk Frother, 4-in-1 Electric Hot & Cold Foam Maker and Milk Foamer for Coffee, Cappuccino, Latte, Macchiato, Matcha Latte, Noiseless Work an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUESz9-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional】: This coffee frother can provide you with hot dense foam, cold milk foam, hot coffee, and hot milk. Just place the magnetic whisk inside the cup and it will stir well to make the milk froth fine and not lumpy. Perfect for matcha latte, albumen powder. 【Quick & Silent Working】: The high-speed magnetic metal stirrer allows this coffee foam maker to create foam and heat up milk within 2 minutes. There is almost no noise during the working process. 【Portable & Stable】: Its small, lightweight design takes up minimal countertop space. When the heating is complete, you can just pick it up and drink it without pouring it out. And the special design brings the milk frothers more stable, ideal for home, office, RV, and so on. You can even make your own cup of albumen powder at the gym. 【Maximum Capacity】: The milk frother and steamer can heat up to 8.1oz/240ml milk for breakfast, or froth up to 3.9oz/115ml foam for latte, cappuccino, matcha latte, albumen powder at a time. When choosing the hot/cold foam function, make sure the amount of milk is below the MAX line for frothing to prevent overflow. 【Easy to Clean】: The interior of the body is made of food-grade stainless steel with a non-stick coating, which is easy to clean with a brush(included) and water. Remember to dry off after washing. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NUESz9-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ucalafee","source_asin":"B0B8CRBP8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CRBP8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CRBP8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
