window.products.push({"id":866646,"name":"moroccan poufs Leather Luxury Ottomans footstools Blue Duck unstuffed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617iMTkWnaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Moroccan leather poufs are a must have for any room of your home and our now available on pre order in my store I have one in every room of my house including the bathroom because you know someone always wants to chat about something when you are trying to relax! These authentic leather ottomans have so many uses around your home, they can be a footstool or used as extra seating, from the living room to the bedroom to the kids playroom. All of these leather poufs are individually made by artisans in Morocco and ethically purchased using fair trade. After sourcing and buying the goat skin, it is cut and hand painted or dyed, then sent to the outskirt of Marrakech to be stitched and finished with silk embroidery by local Moroccan women to show off expert craftsmanship and a result that is durable and will stand the test of time. There are five people involved in making each pouf and it takes up one day to complete it. They are all wonderfully unique, with subtle variations in the colour of the leather and will look beautiful and last for many years to come. Below are all the colours I have in store but if there is a colour you love and you don't see it here, please send me a message and I'll see what I can do size dimension:20 to21 inch high : 12 to 13 inch note: we only sell cover pouf not stuffed pouf coz it cost for extra money shipping We sell retail and wholesale Feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617iMTkWnaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"moroccan poufs","source_asin":"B00GWV9R0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GWV9R0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GWV9R0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":866647,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier for Baby Plants Quiet, 2L Top Fill Humidifier with Essential Oil Diffuser, Vaporiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ra1ZiIu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 Hours & 360° Efficient Nozzle, 100% Air Clean: Pioneered the first high-efficiency cleaning humidifier that integrates purifying and humidification. With the latest micro-electrolysis technology, MILIN top fill humidifier converts water (H2O) into -OH, [O], H+, OH-, and other highly oxidizing cleaning ions. 2L Large Capacity, More Effective: Raise humidity by 25% in just 20mins with a powerful and steady mist output, faster than other humidifiers. High & Middle & Low - 3 mist levels can meet all your humidity needs. The high mist mode of 300ml/h can help you quickly reach the humidity you want. The mist is fine, and the water mist of fewer than 5 microns will not condense into water droplets, and will never wet your floor and beloved furniture. One Key Operation, Smart Cleaning: Equipped with purifying mode, humidifiers for bedroom will perform 1h purifying in high mist, 30mins in medium, and 30mins in low mist. MILIN ultrasonic humidifier will automatically enter medium mist mode when completed.The tiny substances are reduced to neutral water molecules which are gentle to your skin and body after that. Only simply press the mist button and you can adjust the mist output speed during which the corresponding indicator highlights. 3-in-1 Health Guard, Humidifier & Diffuser: With essential oil diffuser, MILIN cool mist humidifier fills your room with your favorite fragrance along with its cool mist. The large capacity of the 2L water tank ensures 20H ultra-long runtime, which is longer than other humidifiers. It can satisfy you for 3 nights of good sleep and help you live a better life. You can easily add water with a large top opening and lid. Max water level line give you instruction to add the water. Auto Shut Off Protection & Whisper Quiet for Sleep: The MILIN humidifier, equipped with ultrasonic technology, enjoys incredible silence with the lowest noise level of 26 dB. Cool mist humidifiers for bedroom quiet are perfect for a restful sleep as the sleep mode keeps all indicators off and runs at the low mist. It stops working and the low water indicator lights up as a reminder when the tank runs out of water. This helps prevents damage to the item and keeps you safe even when sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ra1ZiIu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MiLin","source_asin":"B09QSH6ZJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QSH6ZJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QSH6ZJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
