window.products.push({"id":866650,"name":"Timechee 6 Ft Artificial Christmas Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uk7dcMVgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ADD CHRISTMAS ATMOSPHERE 】The artificial full Christmas tree is an attractive addition for indoor and outdoor decoration, especially for Christmas. Everyone needs a Christmas tree. If you don’t have a real Christmas tree, our artificial full Christmas tree will bring you the same Christmas atmosphere. It is ideal for decorating homes, offices, schools, shops, apartments, and more. 【STURDY METAL STAND】Our 6 ft Christmas tree comes with a sturdy metal base to provide greater support for long-term use. The metal foldable stand provides stability, prevents sway and fall. The attached 3 screws will help to fix the tree and base, which prevent the Christmas tree from toppling. 【QUALITY MATERIALS】The needles of this Christmas tree are made of premium environment-friendly PVC material. The non-flammable and non-allergic PVC material helps to improve safety and makes it a perfect substitute for a real tree. 1000 branch tips are easily spread out and create a full appearance and enough space to hang ornaments. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE AND STORE】Our Christmas tree is separated into three sections, which are easy to assemble, dismantle and store. You just need to connect the base to the largest section of the tree and attach the branches. The branches can easily install into place and fold back up for storage when not in use. 【BEAUTY AND CREATIVITY】The classic designed Christmas tree is equipped with strong branches to hold all kinds of garland and your favorite decorations. There are no extra decorations on the tree for you to use your imagination and decorate the Christmas tree with your family. Our durable Christmas tree will accompany you and your family to spend Christmas every year happily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uk7dcMVgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Timechee","source_asin":"B0995HV3NJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995HV3NJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995HV3NJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
