window.products.push({"id":866762,"name":"Camden Isle Acton Platform Bed, Queen, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":212.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614+rOjqy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Acton Platform Bed is a solidly constructed, durable bed that adds a touch of modern elegance to any bedroom. With a clean & modern look, the Acton bed is a streamlined platform bed with hidden hardware for a sleek look. The Acton’s low profile design ensures its versatility and sophistication, enabling the Acton to serve as the centerpiece of your bedroom no matter the décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614+rOjqy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camden Isle","source_asin":"B09T1NBRRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T1NBRRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T1NBRRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":866763,"name":"SheetKart Wolf Howling to The Moon Tapestry, Wall Hanging Tapestry, Indian Cotton Printed Bohemian Hippie Small Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419Y3BttCdL._AC_.jpg","description":"Wolf Howling at the Moon Mythology and the imagination of the masses have created a popular belief that there is some sort of connection between wolves and the moon - that when the wild canines howl, it’s directly and deliberately at the Earth’s natural satellite. It’s a romantic concept, for sure - one we certainly enjoy telling the kids - but hardly the case in reality. The presence of the moon when a wolf howls, as it turns out, is purely coincidental and circumstantial. Canine experts have found no connection between the phases of the moon and wolf howling. Wolves pipe up more often during the night because they're nocturnal. But why do they point their faces toward the moon and stars when they howl? It's all about acoustics, since projecting their calls upward allows the sound to carry farther. There are emotional rationales that have been put forth for howling of the wolves - that it expresses restlessness, anxiety, stress, frustration, loneliness, and excitement. The more we learn about wolves, the more complex and human-like they seem to become. Recent research has found that wolves howl most frequently to the members of their packs they spend the most time with. That sounds an awful lot like best friends chatting about their day. Keeping this divine concept of wolves in mind, SheetKart with its in-house manufacturing unit has tried to showcase a product depicting this beautiful concept of this nocturnal animal in a Wall Hanging Tapestry which will décor the walls and living area of your home in the most pleasing way. This gorgeous Wolf Howling wall tapestry is hand-crafted in India. The process involves hundreds of humans working at every step to create this fantastic product which takes almost 200 hours of workmanship. With years of our ancestral experience, we are a company of young people trying to bridge the gap of being traditional along with being unconventional.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419Y3BttCdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SheetKart","source_asin":"B078C7S8LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078C7S8LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078C7S8LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
