window.products.push({"id":866868,"name":"Ohomi 6 Pack Silicone Stretch Lids to Keep Food Fresh Perfect for All Kinds of Food Storage Container, Dishwasher Refrigerator and Microwave Safe for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w+xRMCqRL._AC_.jpg","description":"In order to meet the requirement of different customer, the silicone stretch lid include 6 various size: 6.5CM/2.6\" (can stretches to 3\") 9.5CM/3.7\" (can stretches to 4.8\") 11.5CM/4.5\"(can stretches to 5.8\") 14.5CM/5.7\"(can stretches to 7.8\") 16.5CM/6.5\"(can stretches to 8.8\") 20.5CM/8.0\" (can stretches to 9.8\") How to use: 1. Start on the side closest to your body. Place half of the lid over one edge of the container. 2. Stretch the other half of the lid away from you, inching your way around the bowl. 3. Stretch, and then press the top of the lid while pulling the tabs to create a vacuum seal. 4. Pull the sides to ensure a perfect fit. Warming tips: 1. Clean lids and keep them dry before the first use and after each use to prolong the service life. 2. Make sure that silicone lids and the item being covered are completely dry before using them or they will not stay in place. 3. Clean lids with soap and hot water or put in the dishwasher. Avoid abrasive or force-foam cleaners. 4. Lids can be used in the microwave or oven, but are not suitable for placing on the gas or electricity directly for heating. 5. Since the expanding heat and pressure from container may result in damage or injury, it would be better not to seal container completely when you put things covered by lids in Microwave or Oven. 6. You had better not completely seel container when you are using in Microwave or Oven, because the expanding heat and pressure from container, may result in damage or injury. 7.Selecting a size that is slightly smaller than the item you want to cover makes better resultant seal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w+xRMCqRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ohomi","source_asin":"B07KRYTFQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRYTFQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRYTFQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
