window.products.push({"id":866876,"name":"Apaky Silver Foiled Blackout Curtains for Bedroom, Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Curtains with Grommets for Living Room（ 2 Panels, 52 x 45 Inche, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OxhXlRqZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Design: Inspired by the water/plant of nature, bold and dramatic gold/silver foiled pattern on black/green/silver blackout curtains shows the modern aesthetics, to add an elegant and luxury touch to your bedroom or living room. Set of 2 grommet curtain panels. Each blackout curtain panel has 8 stainless steel grommets (1.6 inches inner diameter) on top, fit for most standard curtain rods. Easy to install and hang, and slide smoothly. Light & Noise Control: Woven from 100% quality polyester, soft and smooth blackout curtains block out 80-95% light and reduce outside noise to provide privacy and create a quiet and peaceful environment for rest and sleep. Perfect room darkening curtains for bedroom, kitchen, living room, nursery room, playroom, office and people who need afternoon nap, late sleep and shift change. Balance Room Temperature: Blackout curtains show good thermal insulation performance in summer and heat preservation performance in winter. You can expect more or less reduction on your energy expense. Protect your floor and furniture from cracking and color fading caused by direct sunlight in the long run. Care Instruction: Machine wash with cold water and gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Cool iron on reverse. Compatible with any dry cleaning method. Wrinkle-free and thread trimmed, durable blackout curtains provide a lasting and practical window treatment solution for your rooms. Size Guidance: Room darkening curtains measure 52 Inches Wide by 45/63/84 Inches Long. Suggest to measure your windows first before purchasing. Online customer service always stands by for your inquiry. If you have any question, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OxhXlRqZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Apaky","source_asin":"B09SZ6Q1L7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZ6Q1L7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZ6Q1L7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":866877,"name":"BlueAvocado Reusable Vegetable Grocery Kit, Large, Plum/Doodle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RH-zx6QVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Thanks to a sturdy, reusable design, the clever vegetable grocery bags from BlueAvocado make it possible to load up in the produce department without using a bit of plastic. Crafted from recycled materials with a mesh design, the bags allow mushrooms, peaches, avocados, and more to breathe, while adding minimal weight at the scale. Their openings cinch shut to keep cherries and grapes secure, and they clean up in the washing machine for easy maintenance. In this kit, BlueAvocado includes two large bags and a stuff pouch with a carabineer to attach to other shopping bags or a purse. With a white mesh sack and plum/doodle rim, each bag measures 15-3/4 by 16 inches, and the kit is also available in black, blueberry, and kiwi/wildflower. Adding to the bags’ appeal, BlueAvocado donates 1 percent of sales to women micro-entrepreneurs around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RH-zx6QVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueAvocado","source_asin":"B0034XR5L2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-866877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0034XR5L2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0034XR5L2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
